            "jpName": "オグリキャップ",
            "enName": "Oguri Cap",
            "jpText": "あー……やはりみんな、\r\n美味しいものは好きだよな。",
            "enText": "Hm… So everyone loves delicious food, yes?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 1788132096901053949,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "そりゃあな。",
            "enText": "Of course.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3185663522041360211,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "オグリキャップ",
            "enName": "Oguri Cap",
            "jpText": "！　クリーク、美味しいものだ……！",
            "enText": "That's it, Creek! Something delicious!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4487492205310101299,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "ふふっ、は～い。",
            "enText": "Hehe, you got it.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -3651729798780670555,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "オグリキャップ",
            "enName": "Oguri Cap",
            "jpText": "で、では……甘いものはどうだろうか。\r\nクリームの上にイチゴや桃が\nのっているような……。",
            "enText": "O-Okay… how do you feel about a sweet \ntreat? Like whipped cream with strawberries \nand peaches on top?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -4655563737603427913,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "……まあ、悪かねえな。",
            "enText": "…Huh, that doesn't sound too bad.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 8924743880551248191,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "オグリキャップ",
            "enName": "Oguri Cap",
            "jpText": "クリーク、イナリが悪くないとっ。\r\nこれで誕生日ケーキもクリアだ……！",
            "enText": "Creek, she said it doesn't sound bad. \nThat means we're in the clear for \na birthday cake!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 3107982638337579276,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "はい、よかったですね～。\r\n材料もそろってますし、すぐに作れます♪",
            "enText": "Yes, that's good news. I already have the \ningredients, so I can make it right away♪",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 1962902996996326080,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "オグリキャップ",
            "enName": "Oguri Cap",
            "jpText": "ああ、必ず成功させよう……！\r\n待っていてくれ、イナリっ。",
            "enText": "Great, we'll knock it out of the park! \nJust you wait, Inari.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -1559909557583293137,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "……って。",
            "enText": "Wait…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -3664575176332217107,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "こっそり聞き出したいのか、\nそうでないのかハッキリしろい！",
            "enText": "Are ya tryin' to sneakily tease out \nwhat I want or not?!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -7157804042260728951,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
